{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45074","headline":"和杨明府早秋游法华寺 · 皎然","name":"和杨明府早秋游法华寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"释事出县合，初闻兹山灵。\n寺扉隐天色，影刹遥丁丁。\n碧峰委合沓，香蔓垂蓂苓。\n清景爲公有，放旷云边亭。\n秋赏石潭洁，夜嘉杉月清。\n诵空性不昧，助道迹又经。\n是以於物理，纷然若未形。\n移来字人要，全与此道冥。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45074.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45074","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}